    <Label Name="Title" Style="GalleryTitle" Text="The Falling Ladder" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="36.25" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
    <Label Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="A ladder leans on a wall, with a bucket of paint hanging on it. It slips: the top slides down the wall, the foot slides out.\n\nWhat path does the bucket follow? Drag the ladder's top down and see. Then slide the bucket to the middle: what shape is it now?\n\nThe other green points move the house, resize it and raise its roof." Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="84.25" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
  </Figures>
